# Docs and Tests

## Documentation

Do not generate READMEs, inline comments, changelogs, or other documentation unless explicitly requested.

Do not add comments that narrate what the code does. Comments are only warranted for non-obvious business logic or deep technical constraints that the code cannot convey.

## Tests

Only write tests when:

- explicitly requested,
- modifying existing tests,
- or necessary to prevent a regression.

Do not add tests that trivially assert the obvious.
